stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle : OnEnable, PreviewPref false
    [*] --> Previewing : OnEnable, PreviewPref true, single target, edit mode
    Idle --> Previewing : Preview animation toggle, StartPreview
    Previewing --> Idle : Stop preview toggle, StopPreview
    Previewing --> Idle : OnDisable or selection change
    Previewing --> Idle : playModeStateChanged ExitingEditMode
    state Previewing {
        [*] --> Tick
        Tick --> Tick : PreviewDriver.Update advances AnimationTime, ForceUpdateCanvases, Rebuild, MeshChecksum, QueuePlayerLoopUpdate
    }
    note right of Previewing
        Hidden GameObject OneText Preview (HideAndDontSave)
        carries PreviewDriver. Readouts: Ticks, MovedTicks, DirtiedTicks
    end note
    note right of Idle
        StopPreview destroys the driver, resets AnimationTime to 0,
        ForceUpdateCanvases, RepaintAllViews
    end note
